OL,5,G0900 Winter Road Rescue
OL,6,     FA group of snowplough drivers and
OL,7,     Fvehicle rescue patrols dedicate
OL,8,     Fthemselves, all day every day, to
OL,9,     Fkeeping Britain's roads safe when
OL,10,     Fbig freezes strike.
OL,11,G0935 Outback Truckers
OL,12,     FJonny Rayner faces a seemingly
OL,13,     Fimpossible choice - take on a
OL,14,     Fcrocodile-infested river at 2am or
OL,15,     Fwait until dawn and further delay
OL,16,     Fhis critical run.
OL,17,G1030 Gunsmoke
OL,18,     FAfter Festus's cousin arrives in
OL,19,     FDodge to seek his wisdom on a
OL,20,     Ffamily matter, a series of mishaps
OL,21,     Fbefall the befuddled sidekick of
OL,22,     FMarshall Dillon.
