OL,12,G1235 Gunsmoke
OL,13,     FNewly O'Brian and Kitty are
OL,14,     Fkidnapped by a gang who mistakenly
OL,15,     Fbelieve he is a doctor. But his
OL,16,     Fskills as a gunsmith are key in
OL,17,     Ftheir attempt to escape.
